'''Kabuki Ashura''' (傾奇者のアシュラ, ''Kabukimono no Ashura'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Kabuki Ashura
|image = E 224.png
|appearance = [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 360円 - 1,422円
}}

==Enemy==
Kabuki Ashura has fairly low stats, low range and a 50% chance to knockback Cats. In most stages it appears in, it won't be too much of a threat because of that.

==Strategy==
The best way to deal with it is just spamming attackers that outrange it, such as [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], etc. You'll hardly even notice this enemy if you have enough attackers out on the field.

